==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep (Enemy Base)|Eyes of Forced Unconscious Sleep]].
*Infinite [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*2 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Demon Gory]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*2 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Enmu]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[H. Nah]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**2 [[Demon Gory|Demon Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 93.33~100 seconds<sup>2,800f~3,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**2 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

